  "guide": "`separableCounterexampleRepresentation` is the same $\\widetilde\\rho$ obtained from `traceModelRepresentation` at the fixed family. `SeparableCounterexampleHilbertSpace` is $H_\\tau$. The names `traceGNSUnitary` ($E$) and `tracialRepresentation` ($\\rho_\\phi$) occur in the linked defining construction, explaining the conjugation although they are absent from this short signature.",
